  "query_preview": "..\n(Saturday Night through Friday)\nIssued at 1131 PM CDT Fri Sep 4 2026\n\nIsolated shower and storm coverage may be slightly greater Sunday\nand may also extend farther to the west. Otherwise, more of the\nsame is expected with regards to the heat. The extreme heat will\ncontinue through at least the middle of next week, with heat\nheadlines likely to be required each day.\n\nThe upper ridge may retrograde to the west enough to allow a \nbackdoor cold front to move into the area by late next week, but\nuncertainty is high on just how far south and west any cooler air\nmakes it. Shower and storm chances will also increase if the\nboundary does make it into our area, but rainfall amounts are not\nlikely to be significant.",
